### Hent alle album
GET https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/albums

### Hent album med id=6
GET https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/albums/6

### Legg til et nytt album
POST https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/albums
Content-type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "userId": 1,
  "title": "Rock n Roll"
}

### Endre title på album med id=6
PUT https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/albums/6
Content-type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "userId": 1,
  "title": "Julesanger"
}

